  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment position following the agreement by Korea Forest Service of the TORs and the Budget Plan for provision of technical guidance and programmatic support for projects and activities of the Climate Change and Resilience Team, focusing on Forest and Landscape Restoration (FLR) and Integrated Forest Disaster Risk Management (IFDRM) within the context of FAO&apos;s Strategic Framework and Programme Priority Areas.</narrative>
